    "sections": {
        "description": "OrionX is a fast, lightweight, and flexible WordPress theme for blogs, businesses, and online stores. It features five layout configurations, sidebar options, Elementor page builder compatibility, WooCommerce support, a comprehensive Customizer with live preview, multiple header styles, hook positions for injecting content, RTL language support, and translation-ready code. Advanced features — overlays, mega-menu, side panel, WooCommerce template overrides, quick-start templates, and performance tweaks — are available through the free OrionX Core companion plugin."
    },
